# Round XXV Track C — `&`-of-a-place inside a `*` (deref) operand.
# One costume of the operand-position class; retired by the
# ONE-PRODUCER chokepoint at the `check_expr::Expr::MutableBorrow`
# arm. Deref reaches the chokepoint via the `Expr::Deref` arm
# recursing through `self.check_expr(inner)`.
#
# Pre-fix (measured at HEAD via scout probe): `gg check` clean; the `&`
# was silently allowed as the deref's inner. INTENDED: reject at
# check-time with a single `E_AmpInOperandPosition` — deref's chokepoint
# route on a `Box[T]` inner emits no co-emit companions (single, clean
# error).

int seed():
    return 10

void main():
    Box[int] b = Box(seed())
    int y = *(&b)
    print(y)
